	(text "Input: V_{in} = 12V\nOutput: V_{out} = 12V\n\nSizing Reverse polarity & Gate protection:\nR2 = \nD3 = 15V (max V_{GS}_{protected} = 15V < max V_{GS}_{nominal} = 20V)\n\nSizing Transient overvoltage protection:\nR29 = \nD4 = \n\nSizing Bypass filter:\nC3 = 0.1uF high-frequency bypass (multilayer ceramic)\nC4 = ??uF inductive transient bypass (multilayer ceramic)\n"
